ing.","supportingSentence":"The wet ones stayed indoors until evening.","skill":"detail"},{"question":"In this story, what does dripping mean?","options":["Falling in small drops of water","Making a loud noise","Folding clothes neatly","Hanging from a high line"],"correctAnswer":"Falling in small drops of water","explanation":"The sleeves were dripping because the rain had made them wet.","supportingSentence":"Her brother Nico laughed at the dripping sleeves.","skill":"vocabulary"},{"question":"Why did Marta write a note?","options":["To ask for new shirts","To close the shop","To thank Nico for laughing","To remember to check the sky first"],"correctAnswer":"To remember to check the sky first","explanation":"The note said to look up first, so she would check the sky next time.","supportingSentence":"She wrote a note that said to look up first.","skill":"inference"}],"wordCount":105,"questionCount":5}$q60366$::jsonb,
